WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

00:28.066 --> 00:33.571 align:center line:79%
Our family arrived in this great land of
America at the time of the Pilgrims.

00:37.200 --> 00:41.496 align:center line:79%
They came seeking civil and religious
freedom and to build a better life

00:41.496 --> 00:42.622 align:center line:81%
for their children.

00:47.335 --> 00:52.673 align:center line:79%
The story I tell begins two days
before Christmas, 1805.

00:56.260 --> 01:01.057 align:center line:79%
While living in Sharon, Vermont, our
family was blessed with a son.

01:05.019 --> 01:09.774 align:center line:79%
We called him Joseph, after
the name of his father.

01:28.960 --> 01:29.961 align:center line:81%
Supper's ready.

01:33.923 --> 01:36.384 align:center line:79%
It is thought by some, that
I shall tell many

01:36.384 --> 01:39.720 align:center line:79%
remarkable incidents  which
attended Joseph’s childhood.

01:40.346 --> 01:45.143 align:center line:79%
But nothing occurred during his early
life except those trivial circumstances

01:45.143 --> 01:47.895 align:center line:79%
which are common to that state
of human existence.

01:49.355 --> 01:53.276 align:center line:79%
My husband farmed in the summer,
taught school in the winter.

01:53.609 --> 01:57.446 align:center line:79%
We worked hard and raised our
children to fear God.

01:58.197 --> 02:01.409 align:center line:81%
Let's see. Thank you, Catherine.

02:02.410 --> 02:05.121 align:center line:79%
Yesterday we were reading
in the Gospel of John.

02:05.163 --> 02:07.874 align:center line:81%
Our family consisted of nine children.

02:11.586 --> 02:15.423 align:center line:79%
Alvin was the oldest and a
hero in Joseph's eyes.

02:16.674 --> 02:19.302 align:center line:81%
As was Hyrum, our second oldest.

02:21.012 --> 02:24.557 align:center line:79%
They in turn, saw something special
in their younger brother.

02:25.224 --> 02:26.225 align:center line:81%
We all did.

02:30.188 --> 02:32.857 align:center line:81%
God gives us power over temptation,

02:34.358 --> 02:36.319 align:center line:81%
but we are weak in the face of it.

02:38.029 --> 02:41.866 align:center line:79%
All of us have sinned and fall
short of the glory of God.

02:43.534 --> 02:46.495 align:center line:79%
Therefore, we must repent
and be baptized.

02:46.537 --> 02:48.748 align:center line:81%
It is the only path to His kingdom.

02:54.337 --> 02:59.050 align:center line:79%
Mr. Smith, a word, please. You
seem to be a God-fearing man,

02:59.050 --> 03:02.470 align:center line:79%
but I don’t see you with your
family in my congregation.

03:04.513 --> 03:06.557 align:center line:81%
It seems that preaching nowadays

03:07.516 --> 03:09.769 align:center line:81%
teaches folks to fear God too much,

03:13.022 --> 03:14.357 align:center line:81%
trust in Him too little.

03:16.442 --> 03:18.236 align:center line:81%
You’re a difficult man, Mr. Smith.

03:18.945 --> 03:19.946 align:center line:81%
I don’t mean to be.

03:21.781 --> 03:23.658 align:center line:81%
Just concerned for your salvation.

03:25.451 --> 03:28.788 align:center line:81%
Do right and go to Jesus.

03:29.705 --> 03:35.294 align:center line:79%
Alvin, have you ever wondered 
what we need to do to be saved?

03:40.424 --> 03:42.009 align:center line:81%
You worry too much, little brother.

03:43.344 --> 03:45.554 align:center line:81%
But I need to know.

03:49.308 --> 03:52.186 align:center line:79%
You remember that seashell you
found at Uncle Jesse’s?

03:53.437 --> 03:54.438 align:center line:81%
Yeah.

03:56.274 --> 04:00.069 align:center line:79%
Well, some small creature
made that shell, Joseph.

04:00.319 --> 04:03.614 align:center line:79%
Layer by layer until it
finally outgrew it.

04:05.908 --> 04:11.414 align:center line:79%
Maybe...maybe God intends
for us to outgrow ourselves to.

04:13.916 --> 04:19.672 align:center line:79%
I just, I can’t believe He’d only
want to save a few of us.

04:22.300 --> 04:24.635 align:center line:81%
If you embrace false doctrine,

04:24.927 --> 04:29.098 align:center line:79%
you can expect coldness and
darkness all your life.

04:29.765 --> 04:33.561 align:center line:79%
The Bible teaches that there is only
one way to salvation, Joseph.

04:41.777 --> 04:47.033 align:center line:79%
Study the word of God and you will
know the truth of what I say.

04:51.412 --> 04:54.081 align:center line:81%
With his mind considerably troubled,

04:54.206 --> 04:57.168 align:center line:81%
Joseph continued his search for answers.

04:58.127 --> 05:00.171 align:center line:79%
A search that would have
been difficult even

05:00.171 --> 05:03.007 align:center line:79%
for those much older than he
who had the benefit of

05:03.007 --> 05:05.009 align:center line:81%
an education he never had.

05:09.513 --> 05:17.188 align:center line:79%
I was one day reading the epistle of
James, “If any of you lack wisdom,

05:18.481 --> 05:20.191 align:center line:81%
let him ask of God.”

05:23.402 --> 05:26.280 align:center line:79%
The words came with great
force into my heart.

05:29.158 --> 05:31.911 align:center line:81%
I reflected upon them again and again.

05:34.789 --> 05:40.169 align:center line:79%
At length, I came to the conclusion
that I must do as James directs.

05:41.629 --> 05:44.632 align:center line:81%
That is, ask of God.

05:50.846 --> 05:56.727 align:center line:79%
It was on the morning of a beautiful,
clear day early in the spring of 1820.

06:13.744 --> 06:20.501 align:center line:79%
I kneeled down and began to offer up
the desires of my heart to God.

06:53.284 --> 07:01.792 align:center line:79%
I was seized upon by some power—an
actual being from the unseen world.

07:04.378 --> 07:08.841 align:center line:79%
Exerting all my strength
to call upon God,

07:13.804 --> 07:16.098 align:center line:81%
I saw a pillar of light.

07:36.660 --> 07:41.707 align:center line:79%
When the light rested upon me,
I saw two personages.

07:47.046 --> 07:50.007 align:center line:81%
One of them spake unto me.

07:52.885 --> 07:53.886 align:center line:81%
Joseph,

07:57.348 --> 07:58.641 align:center line:81%
this is my beloved Son,

08:00.851 --> 08:01.852 align:center line:81%
hear Him.

08:08.025 --> 08:09.735 align:center line:81%
I am Jesus Christ.

08:24.124 --> 08:27.086 align:center line:81%
I saw God the Father

08:27.586 --> 08:35.844 align:center line:79%
and His Son, Jesus Christ. They did in
reality, speak to me. I knew it.

08:37.054 --> 08:41.725 align:center line:79%
And I knew that God knew it,
and I could not deny it.

08:48.566 --> 08:53.571 align:center line:79%
I was told in the vision to
join none of the churches.

08:53.946 --> 08:58.033 align:center line:79%
But that the gospel in its fullness
was about to be restored.

09:03.622 --> 09:05.416 align:center line:81%
I’m grateful for your help, Joseph,

09:09.253 --> 09:10.879 align:center line:81%
but you must know how I feel.

09:13.966 --> 09:19.722 align:center line:79%
There are no such things as visions
and revelations in these days.

09:20.139 --> 09:22.099 align:center line:81%
All of that ceased with the Apostles,

09:22.099 --> 09:24.518 align:center line:81%
and there will never be any more of it.

09:29.940 --> 09:34.445 align:center line:79%
Don't speak of it further. It
will only bring you grief.

09:45.289 --> 09:48.250 align:center line:79%
Hey, Joseph, you seen
any visions lately?

09:51.253 --> 09:55.215 align:center line:79%
Mind your own business, Smith.
Worry about your brother.

10:10.397 --> 10:17.029 align:center line:79%
In September 1823, as he again
opened his heart to God,

10:17.738 --> 10:20.658 align:center line:79%
Joseph was visited by a
heavenly messenger.

10:26.038 --> 10:30.584 align:center line:81%
Joseph. I am your fellow servant.

10:31.752 --> 10:33.462 align:center line:81%
Moses truly said-

10:33.629 --> 10:38.008 align:center line:79%
He said his name was Moroni and that
God had a work for me to do.

10:39.843 --> 10:43.347 align:center line:79%
He told me of an ancient record
written upon gold plates,

10:43.555 --> 10:45.766 align:center line:79%
giving an account of the
former inhabitants

10:45.766 --> 10:46.809 align:center line:81%
of this continent.

10:52.356 --> 10:55.442 align:center line:79%
The writing on the gold plates
was unknown to me.

10:56.193 --> 10:58.487 align:center line:79%
I was told the plates contained
a fullness of

10:58.487 --> 11:00.239 align:center line:81%
the gospel of Jesus Christ.

11:04.702 --> 11:06.745 align:center line:81%
Joseph was given knowledge of

11:06.745 --> 11:12.209 align:center line:79%
an appearance that Jesus Christ Himself
made after the resurrection to

11:12.209 --> 11:14.461 align:center line:81%
the people of ancient America.

11:16.463 --> 11:20.175 align:center line:79%
During this visit, Jesus invited
the people to feel

11:20.175 --> 11:24.638 align:center line:79%
the wound marks in His hands,
feet, and His side.

11:25.472 --> 11:31.854 align:center line:79%
He called 12 apostles to teach His
gospel and performed miracles.

11:33.564 --> 11:38.485 align:center line:79%
Joseph could describe this as though he
had spent his whole life with them.

11:39.611 --> 11:41.488 align:center line:81%
I think that we presented

11:41.488 --> 11:45.909 align:center line:79%
the most peculiar aspect of any family
that ever lived upon the earth.

11:46.994 --> 11:50.038 align:center line:79%
All of us giving the most
profound attention to

11:50.038 --> 11:55.961 align:center line:79%
a boy 17 years of age who had never read
the Bible through in his life.

11:57.087 --> 12:00.716 align:center line:79%
In time, Joseph would be given
the knowledge to translate

12:00.716 --> 12:03.010 align:center line:79%
the record which had been
revealed to him.

12:03.635 --> 12:08.015 align:center line:79%
Until then, he was instructed
to wait and prepare.

12:10.642 --> 12:15.147 align:center line:79%
That preparation would include more
challenges to His trust in God.

12:16.648 --> 12:17.691 align:center line:81%
I'm sorry.

12:18.817 --> 12:20.986 align:center line:81%
I’ve done everything I know how to do.

12:26.700 --> 12:32.581 align:center line:79%
Our beloved oldest son, and
Joseph’s hero on Earth...

12:39.338 --> 12:45.260 align:center line:79%
Joseph, if Alvin dies without being
baptized, he will never see heaven.

12:47.805 --> 12:49.306 align:center line:81%
I wish I could say otherwise.

12:58.398 --> 13:04.613 align:center line:81%
Joseph, I’m sorry. I truly am sorry.

13:13.247 --> 13:18.502 align:center line:81%
Hyrum, you’re the oldest now.

13:23.298 --> 13:24.299 align:center line:81%
Joseph,

13:28.887 --> 13:33.016 align:center line:81%
do everything you can

13:34.184 --> 13:35.644 align:center line:81%
to obtain the record.

13:38.063 --> 13:39.064 align:center line:81%
Everything.

14:01.503 --> 14:08.635 align:center line:79%
God has given travail to the sons 
of man. For dust we are, and unto dust

14:08.635 --> 14:09.845 align:center line:81%
shall we return.

14:50.344 --> 14:56.642 align:center line:79%
Perhaps God is trying to warn you
Joseph. Alvin is lost,

14:57.559 --> 14:59.478 align:center line:81%
but there is still hope for you.

15:01.730 --> 15:04.316 align:center line:81%
Forget these foolish notions.

15:13.367 --> 15:16.995 align:center line:79%
But it was Alvin's words that
were in Joseph's mind.

15:17.871 --> 15:22.209 align:center line:79%
I can't believe God would want
to save just a few of us.

15:25.253 --> 15:27.172 align:center line:81%
As Joseph grew to manhood,

15:27.214 --> 15:30.133 align:center line:79%
he continued to ponder
all that had happened

15:30.133 --> 15:33.303 align:center line:79%
and to wonder about all he had been
promised was yet to come.

15:33.345 --> 15:34.596 align:center line:81%
The same tomorrow, boys.

15:36.348 --> 15:39.351 align:center line:79%
It was during this time he
became acquainted with

15:39.351 --> 15:41.561 align:center line:81%
a young woman named Emma Hale.

15:57.244 --> 16:01.123 align:center line:79%
As so often happened, rumors
preceded Joseph.

16:03.959 --> 16:07.796 align:center line:81%
Father has heard some, stories.

16:08.422 --> 16:12.259 align:center line:79%
Well, what if I told you
that they were true?

16:15.137 --> 16:21.643 align:center line:79%
He told her of all that had happened.
She would have to decide for herself.

16:26.815 --> 16:31.778 align:center line:79%
If any of you lack wisdom,
let him ask of God.

16:34.072 --> 16:35.198 align:center line:81%
That's what I did.

16:48.170 --> 16:49.171 align:center line:81%
You win.

17:02.976 --> 17:04.019 align:center line:81%
There's something I want to show you.

17:08.190 --> 17:10.358 align:center line:79%
I’ve thought a great deal 
about what you told me.

17:11.651 --> 17:12.652 align:center line:81%
And?

17:13.820 --> 17:14.988 align:center line:81%
I believe you.

17:18.325 --> 17:20.786 align:center line:81%
Although her parents did not approve,

17:20.952 --> 17:24.247 align:center line:79%
Joseph and Emma were married
the following year.

17:28.085 --> 17:33.006 align:center line:79%
For four years, Joseph returned each
September to the hiding place of

17:33.006 --> 17:38.512 align:center line:79%
the sacred record. Each time he received
further knowledge until

17:38.595 --> 17:43.850 align:center line:79%
at length, he was given permission 
to begin the long-promised translation.

17:46.353 --> 17:48.563 align:center line:81%
You marry a dreamer, Emma.

17:49.648 --> 17:50.690 align:center line:81%
Translate?

17:51.858 --> 17:53.401 align:center line:81%
He can hardly read and write.

17:57.280 --> 18:04.079 align:center line:79%
Until he gives up these foolish ideas,
he is no longer welcome in this house.

18:10.168 --> 18:14.756 align:center line:79%
He'll change his mind after
the baby comes.

18:23.682 --> 18:29.896 align:center line:79%
They named their first child Alvin,
after Joseph’s beloved older brother.

18:30.689 --> 18:33.108 align:center line:81%
He lived only a few hours.

18:37.737 --> 18:42.033 align:center line:79%
During their 17 years together,
they would see many sorrows.

18:44.286 --> 18:50.625 align:center line:79%
The Lord called Joseph in his weakness.
But He qualified him for His work.

18:51.501 --> 18:58.550 align:center line:79%
The translation continued. Others joined
Joseph in this great undertaking.

18:58.592 --> 19:01.094 align:center line:81%
“All men must repent

19:02.179 --> 19:05.015 align:center line:81%
and be baptized in his name.”

19:05.056 --> 19:07.350 align:center line:81%
One such was Oliver Cowdery.

19:07.392 --> 19:09.060 align:center line:81%
How are we to be baptized?

19:14.482 --> 19:15.483 align:center line:81%
I don't know.

19:18.195 --> 19:24.618 align:center line:79%
In May 1829, Joseph and Oliver
inquired of the Lord.

19:25.160 --> 19:28.538 align:center line:79%
A messenger from heaven descended
in a cloud of light.

19:29.122 --> 19:34.920 align:center line:79%
He said he was John the Baptist, the
same who had baptized Jesus Christ.

19:35.462 --> 19:39.716 align:center line:79%
He laid his hands upon their heads
and gave Joseph and Oliver

19:39.716 --> 19:42.135 align:center line:81%
the authority to baptize.

19:43.511 --> 19:50.101 align:center line:79%
Later, Peter, James, and John,
three of Christ’s original Apostles,

19:50.185 --> 19:55.106 align:center line:79%
restored the same authority they were
given anciently by Jesus Christ.

19:55.106 --> 19:58.735 align:center line:79%
So that man could once again
act in all things for

19:58.735 --> 20:00.695 align:center line:81%
the salvation of His children.

20:01.905 --> 20:06.076 align:center line:79%
The work of translation finished and
Joseph returned the plates to

20:06.076 --> 20:12.123 align:center line:79%
the angel Moroni. The ancient record was
published as the Book of Mormon:

20:12.165 --> 20:14.584 align:center line:81%
Another Witness of Jesus Christ.

20:15.377 --> 20:19.881 align:center line:79%
I have been asked many times if
the Book of Mormon is true.

20:20.757 --> 20:27.889 align:center line:79%
The scriptures say, “Prove all things.”
Read it and ask God.

20:29.557 --> 20:32.060 align:center line:81%
“And when ye shall receive these things,

20:32.060 --> 20:34.771 align:center line:79%
I would exhort you that
ye would ask God, the

20:34.854 --> 20:40.026 align:center line:79%
eternal Father, in the name of Christ
if these things are not true;

20:41.361 --> 20:46.032 align:center line:79%
and if you shall ask with a sincere
heart, with real intent,

20:47.033 --> 20:53.540 align:center line:79%
having faith in Christ, he will
manifest the truth of it unto you by

20:53.540 --> 20:59.212 align:center line:79%
the power of the Holy Ghost. And
by the power of the Holy Ghost,

20:59.838 --> 21:02.340 align:center line:81%
ye may know the truth of all things.”

21:10.390 --> 21:13.226 align:center line:79%
Is this book meant to
replace the Bible?

21:15.103 --> 21:17.564 align:center line:81%
Nothing can replace the Bible, Father.

21:19.024 --> 21:23.069 align:center line:79%
This is another witness of
the glory of Christ.

21:26.031 --> 21:31.870 align:center line:79%
My husband was baptized by immersion
on April 6, 1830,

21:31.953 --> 21:37.334 align:center line:79%
the day The Church of Jesus Christ of
Latter-day Saints was organized.

21:38.376 --> 21:42.088 align:center line:79%
When he came up out of the water,
Joseph exclaimed,

21:42.589 --> 21:48.970 align:center line:79%
“Praise to my God that I have lived to
see my own father baptized into

21:48.970 --> 21:50.764 align:center line:81%
the Church of Jesus Christ!”

21:53.266 --> 21:55.477 align:center line:81%
With Christ's priesthood authority,

21:55.769 --> 21:59.898 align:center line:79%
the same Church that Jesus 
Christ established anciently,

22:00.023 --> 22:02.525 align:center line:81%
was restored to the Earth.

22:02.609 --> 22:06.613 align:center line:79%
That we proceed and organize ourselves
as a church according to

22:06.613 --> 22:11.910 align:center line:79%
the commandments of God. All those who
are in favor, please so indicate.

22:17.791 --> 22:18.792 align:center line:81%
O God,

22:18.792 --> 22:20.377 align:center line:81%
the eternal Father...

22:34.182 --> 22:39.229 align:center line:79%
Are you still determined to organize
this church of yours?

22:41.606 --> 22:47.487 align:center line:79%
The Lord has commanded it. But it
is not my church. It is His.

22:47.946 --> 22:50.323 align:center line:81%
It is the Church of Jesus Christ.

23:05.130 --> 23:06.131 align:center line:81%
I kept my promise.

23:13.513 --> 23:17.600 align:center line:79%
Mr. Smith, forgive the intrusion,
but I wonder,

23:19.185 --> 23:21.187 align:center line:81%
could you tell me more about that book?

23:22.564 --> 23:24.983 align:center line:81%
Yes. Yes, I could.

23:33.158 --> 23:35.535 align:center line:79%
I do not believe in your religion,
Mr. Smith.

23:37.162 --> 23:39.581 align:center line:81%
But I do thank you for your kindness.

23:40.874 --> 23:42.834 align:center line:79%
You might say that is
our religion, ma'am.

23:43.710 --> 23:45.503 align:center line:81%
Well, I’ve never been thrown by anyone,

23:46.129 --> 23:48.381 align:center line:79%
so I’ll just apologize now, 
Brother Joseph.

23:49.799 --> 23:54.137 align:center line:79%
Sometimes the Lord brings us low
before He can lift us higher.

23:56.139 --> 23:57.891 align:center line:81%
Have you begun?

24:09.903 --> 24:12.906 align:center line:79%
Brothers and sisters be not
weary in well doing.

24:13.281 --> 24:16.117 align:center line:79%
For when we are in the service
of our fellow beings,

24:16.284 --> 24:18.661 align:center line:81%
we are only in the service of our God.

24:19.746 --> 24:22.916 align:center line:79%
We do not ask people to give
up any good that they have.

24:23.374 --> 24:26.669 align:center line:79%
We only invite them to
come and to get more.

24:29.380 --> 24:33.635 align:center line:79%
And they did come. The word
spread very fast.

24:33.927 --> 24:38.765 align:center line:79%
Many new members began to gather
in Missouri and Ohio.

24:39.933 --> 24:42.894 align:center line:79%
These Mormons will soon be taking
over the whole county.

24:43.770 --> 24:47.607 align:center line:79%
Can you imagine picking up and leaving
everything behind on the word of

24:47.607 --> 24:49.317 align:center line:81%
a so-called prophet?

24:50.818 --> 24:53.029 align:center line:81%
I hear they worship Joseph Smith.

24:53.404 --> 25:00.286 align:center line:79%
Well, there's one way to find out.
Joseph? Yes, Mother.

25:00.578 --> 25:04.040 align:center line:81%
My new friend here has a question.

25:06.960 --> 25:10.547 align:center line:79%
We only worship God the Father
and His Son, Jesus Christ.

25:10.880 --> 25:13.550 align:center line:81%
And all this talk of revelation.

25:13.758 --> 25:15.426 align:center line:81%
That is how we learn His will.

25:16.719 --> 25:21.182 align:center line:79%
What makes you so certain, Mr. Smith,
that God even cares?

25:23.351 --> 25:29.691 align:center line:79%
He does care. And you can know it.
But first you have to trust Him.

25:31.734 --> 25:38.116 align:center line:79%
The message was always the same.
Read for yourself and ask God.

25:40.118 --> 25:42.829 align:center line:79%
Many of our neighbors
would do just that.

25:44.747 --> 25:47.500 align:center line:79%
But there were others
who felt threatened.

25:49.502 --> 25:52.338 align:center line:79%
This time tomorrow, Joseph
Smith will be long gone.

25:52.463 --> 25:53.464 align:center line:81%
Yeah.

25:53.631 --> 25:55.216 align:center line:81%
Running like a scared rabbit.

25:58.094 --> 26:01.598 align:center line:79%
Perhaps fearful of a doctrine
they did not understand,

26:02.390 --> 26:06.185 align:center line:79%
perhaps distrustful of
so many new arrivals.

26:14.694 --> 26:17.447 align:center line:81%
There he is! Grab him!

26:21.242 --> 26:24.871 align:center line:81%
Come on! Emma! Emma the children!

26:39.135 --> 26:40.136 align:center line:81%
Hold Him!

26:41.638 --> 26:42.639 align:center line:81%
Why do this?

26:44.682 --> 26:45.850 align:center line:81%
Put the tar in his mouth!

26:45.850 --> 26:46.851 align:center line:81%
Why are you doing this?

26:56.027 --> 26:59.530 align:center line:79%
It is difficult to take the
measure of such things.

27:02.659 --> 27:04.577 align:center line:81%
There will always be opposition.

27:06.746 --> 27:09.040 align:center line:81%
How much do we have to endure?

27:14.837 --> 27:18.091 align:center line:79%
Perhaps I am meant to
swim in deep water.

27:22.512 --> 27:23.930 align:center line:81%
Better deep than shallow.

27:34.065 --> 27:36.484 align:center line:81%
Pray unto the Father with all

27:36.484 --> 27:40.196 align:center line:79%
the energy of heart that ye may
be filled with this love.

27:40.655 --> 27:43.658 align:center line:79%
God has restored to the earth
the spirit of prophecy

27:43.658 --> 27:48.538 align:center line:79%
and of revelation. I am a witness
that Jesus is the Christ.

27:54.043 --> 27:57.505 align:center line:79%
He invites all men to repent
and to come unto Him.

27:59.757 --> 28:03.928 align:center line:79%
He will bear our grief. He
will carry our burdens.

28:04.387 --> 28:09.976 align:center line:79%
And if we are faithful, we may have
this hope, that we may be purified,

28:10.601 --> 28:12.061 align:center line:81%
even as He is pure.

28:17.233 --> 28:19.402 align:center line:81%
The little town of Kirtland, Ohio,

28:19.402 --> 28:24.115 align:center line:79%
grew at such a rate that houses could
scarcely be built fast enough.

28:26.159 --> 28:27.660 align:center line:81%
Emma? Emma?

28:32.206 --> 28:34.375 align:center line:81%
Their family just arrived.

28:34.709 --> 28:35.710 align:center line:81%
Who have we here?

28:35.710 --> 28:40.506 align:center line:79%
That’s Rachel, Susan, and Abigail. But
she prefers Abby.

28:40.506 --> 28:41.507 align:center line:81%
Oh, really?

28:41.507 --> 28:43.259 align:center line:81%
Mm-hmm. Abby.

28:47.263 --> 28:52.685 align:center line:79%
The Jacobsons are in our room tonight.
I thought their home was finished.

28:53.519 --> 29:00.485 align:center line:79%
It is, except for the hanging of the
doors and closing the back wall.

29:07.158 --> 29:08.785 align:center line:81%
So what is all the excitement about?

29:10.244 --> 29:13.456 align:center line:79%
The Lord has commanded us to
build a house to His name.

29:14.624 --> 29:15.666 align:center line:81%
What kind of a house?

29:18.252 --> 29:24.008 align:center line:79%
A house of holiness where the Lord
can grant us knowledge and power

29:24.008 --> 29:28.262 align:center line:81%
and authority. A temple, like

29:28.262 --> 29:31.974 align:center line:79%
the one where Jesus Christ taught
His disciples in Jerusalem.

29:33.392 --> 29:38.314 align:center line:79%
And will we build this temple before or 
after the walls go on the Jacobson home?

29:47.865 --> 29:51.953 align:center line:79%
Soon, Church members were
donating one day in ten to build

29:51.953 --> 29:53.538 align:center line:81%
a temple to their God.

29:53.704 --> 29:55.331 align:center line:81%
You know you've got a good heart, Lyman.

29:56.082 --> 29:57.667 align:center line:81%
Certainly hope you've got a good eye.

30:00.753 --> 30:02.338 align:center line:81%
The first time I read this book,

30:03.297 --> 30:08.553 align:center line:79%
I knew that no mere man could have
written it. Joseph truly is a prophet.

30:09.679 --> 30:10.763 align:center line:81%
You're right, Parley.

30:14.350 --> 30:17.728 align:center line:79%
He's everything I expected.
Sometimes more.

30:18.396 --> 30:23.734 align:center line:79%
One of the hardest working among them
was a new convert, Brigham Young.

30:24.819 --> 30:29.615 align:center line:79%
Joseph opens up in plainness things
that I’d never understood before.

30:32.493 --> 30:33.494 align:center line:81%
Good morning, Brigham.

30:33.494 --> 30:34.495 align:center line:81%
Joseph.

30:36.664 --> 30:40.209 align:center line:79%
Joseph began to rely on 
Brigham’s skill as a builder

30:40.501 --> 30:43.170 align:center line:81%
and recognized his deepening faith.

30:45.631 --> 30:50.678 align:center line:79%
This should be our finest work, Brigham.
Nothing but the best for the Lord.

30:53.180 --> 30:57.476 align:center line:79%
We’re not just building a temple here,
the Lord is building us.

31:00.187 --> 31:03.024 align:center line:79%
But how can He call someone
like me to be an apostle?

31:03.065 --> 31:04.859 align:center line:81%
You have been prepared, Brigham.

31:05.526 --> 31:10.072 align:center line:79%
The Lord takes raw materials, shapes
them, and refines them.

31:11.282 --> 31:13.701 align:center line:79%
The Lord has great things in
mind for you, Brigham.

31:14.160 --> 31:17.413 align:center line:81%
Greater than you have ever dreamed of.

31:17.413 --> 31:21.250 align:center line:79%
Brigham Young. In the name of Jesus
Christ, we lay our hands upon your head,

31:22.627 --> 31:25.296 align:center line:79%
and ordain you to the 
Office of High Priest.

31:33.429 --> 31:36.891 align:center line:79%
The Kirtland Temple became the
connection between heaven

31:36.891 --> 31:39.226 align:center line:79%
and earth that our people
were looking for.

31:39.226 --> 31:40.227 align:center line:81%
President.

31:40.227 --> 31:41.228 align:center line:81%
Thank you, Brethren

31:41.228 --> 31:42.313 align:center line:81%
Joseph, thank you. Pleasant evening.

31:43.230 --> 31:44.315 align:center line:81%
Hyrum will be with us.

31:45.358 --> 31:50.738 align:center line:79%
Not only a symbol of God’s presence,
but a pathway for His word.

32:22.895 --> 32:23.896 align:center line:81%
What is it?

32:24.855 --> 32:25.856 align:center line:81%
Mother.

32:27.566 --> 32:35.533 align:center line:79%
Tonight in the temple. I saw a vision
of the Celestial Kingdom of God.

32:37.493 --> 32:42.123 align:center line:79%
The voice of the Lord revealed
these words.

32:44.000 --> 32:50.631 align:center line:79%
“All who die without a knowledge of this
gospel, who would have received it,

32:52.758 --> 32:55.011 align:center line:81%
will be heirs of the Kingdom of God.”

32:58.472 --> 33:02.143 align:center line:81%
Mother, Alvin is not lost.

33:05.604 --> 33:11.986 align:center line:79%
Joseph’s prophecy was fulfilled. The
Lord did come to His temple.

33:12.194 --> 33:16.657 align:center line:81%
Behold, I have accepted this house.

33:17.908 --> 33:23.456 align:center line:79%
Other heavenly messengers appeared.
Old Testament prophets. Moses.

33:23.789 --> 33:25.041 align:center line:81%
In you and your seed...

33:25.041 --> 33:26.042 align:center line:81%
Elias

33:26.042 --> 33:29.587 align:center line:79%
All generations shall be blessed
to turn the hearts of the fathers..

33:29.587 --> 33:30.588 align:center line:81%
And Elijah

33:30.713 --> 33:34.216 align:center line:79%
to the children, and the children
to their fathers.

33:37.887 --> 33:42.433 align:center line:79%
The Lord built us in wonderful ways
as He revealed through Joseph

33:42.475 --> 33:46.020 align:center line:81%
line upon line precept upon precept,

33:46.562 --> 33:49.148 align:center line:81%
every truth, every principle,

33:49.482 --> 33:53.694 align:center line:79%
every doctrine of Christ pertaining
to life and salvation.

33:54.278 --> 33:59.200 align:center line:79%
God is the Father of our spirits.
Jesus Christ is His Son.

34:00.159 --> 34:04.205 align:center line:79%
Their work and their glory is to
bring to pass the immortality

34:04.205 --> 34:06.207 align:center line:81%
and eternal life of man.

34:07.541 --> 34:09.835 align:center line:79%
It's time we got rid of these
Mormons for good.

34:11.212 --> 34:13.714 align:center line:81%
And if we need to kill a few to do it...

34:16.467 --> 34:17.468 align:center line:81%
all the better.

34:17.802 --> 34:22.014 align:center line:79%
Some of the older settlers became
jealous of our growing influence.

34:22.807 --> 34:26.018 align:center line:79%
Suspicion and fear took
root in ignorance.

34:26.310 --> 34:30.731 align:center line:79%
Petty harassments turned into 
persistent slander and violence.

34:36.487 --> 34:40.241 align:center line:81%
Why are you doing this? Why? Why?

34:40.866 --> 34:43.744 align:center line:79%
It is beyond me to answer
such questions.

34:45.704 --> 34:48.833 align:center line:81%
How can we leave this behind Joseph?

34:50.376 --> 34:52.378 align:center line:81%
I'm not the only one under threat now.

34:54.839 --> 34:57.299 align:center line:79%
It has become too dangerous
here for everyone.

34:58.050 --> 35:04.473 align:center line:79%
That is what we must consider.
A temple, we can rebuild.

35:06.475 --> 35:08.144 align:center line:81%
We cannot replace lives.

35:10.312 --> 35:12.231 align:center line:81%
Will things be better in Missouri?

35:56.066 --> 36:00.613 align:center line:79%
It seemed wherever our people tried
to settle, conflict followed.

36:02.698 --> 36:05.993 align:center line:79%
Missouri proved to be
the refiner’s fire.

36:08.537 --> 36:10.539 align:center line:81%
Momma, Momma, please!

36:24.428 --> 36:26.931 align:center line:81%
No! No!

36:35.940 --> 36:39.610 align:center line:79%
This isn’t just a mob. 
There are 2500 Missouri

36:39.610 --> 36:43.739 align:center line:79%
Militiamen standing against us with
that order from Governor Boggs.

36:48.077 --> 36:53.123 align:center line:79%
Mormons must be treated as
enemies and exterminated

36:53.874 --> 36:55.542 align:center line:81%
or driven from the state.

36:57.127 --> 36:59.129 align:center line:81%
For the public peace.

37:01.257 --> 37:04.802 align:center line:79%
18 of our brothers and sisters
lay dead at Haun's Mill.

37:05.761 --> 37:08.222 align:center line:79%
Is this the public peace
the governor speaks of?

37:09.139 --> 37:13.644 align:center line:79%
Fathers and mothers and 
children slaughtered for

37:13.644 --> 37:16.855 align:center line:79%
the crime of building homes
and worshiping God.

37:16.855 --> 37:21.193 align:center line:79%
You should make this very point.
Accept the offer, I beg you.

37:42.840 --> 37:47.428 align:center line:79%
General Lucas. I was told you
wanted to talk with me.

37:53.183 --> 37:56.020 align:center line:79%
Here are your prisoners, 
General. As we agreed.

37:59.189 --> 38:03.027 align:center line:79%
When we heard that Joseph and
Hyrum had been betrayed,

38:03.360 --> 38:07.239 align:center line:79%
we were filled with mourning,
lamentation and woe.

38:09.575 --> 38:12.161 align:center line:81%
Gentlemen. Gentlemen, please.

38:15.122 --> 38:16.832 align:center line:81%
Tomorrow morning at 9:00,

38:16.832 --> 38:21.003 align:center line:79%
General Doniphan and his 
brigade will take these men

38:21.670 --> 38:24.214 align:center line:81%
to the town square in Far West,

38:25.549 --> 38:27.217 align:center line:81%
and he will shoot them.

38:28.635 --> 38:30.262 align:center line:81%
In the midst of my grief,

38:30.262 --> 38:34.391 align:center line:79%
I was comforted by the Spirit
of the Lord and received

38:34.391 --> 38:39.438 align:center line:79%
the following promise: “Your
son shall not be harmed.

38:39.855 --> 38:42.566 align:center line:81%
And in five years from this time,

38:42.566 --> 38:45.861 align:center line:79%
Joseph will have power
over all his enemies.”

38:48.030 --> 38:49.239 align:center line:81%
This is cold-blooded murder.

38:52.576 --> 38:53.827 align:center line:81%
These men are innocent.

38:57.039 --> 38:58.415 align:center line:81%
I will not obey your order.

39:00.292 --> 39:03.670 align:center line:79%
And if you execute them, I will
hold you responsible before

39:03.670 --> 39:05.964 align:center line:81%
an earthly tribunal. So help me God.

39:17.351 --> 39:19.186 align:center line:81%
Though their lives were spared,

39:19.436 --> 39:23.774 align:center line:79%
Joseph and Hyrum found themselves
charged with treason against

39:23.774 --> 39:27.903 align:center line:79%
the state of Missouri and treated
as prisoners of war.

39:30.489 --> 39:31.698 align:center line:81%
Who's going to save you now?

39:34.076 --> 39:38.122 align:center line:79%
Prophesy Smith! Give us one
of your revelations.

39:40.833 --> 39:42.084 align:center line:81%
Tell us, Joe.

39:42.418 --> 39:44.878 align:center line:81%
Tell us more about Haun's Mill.

39:46.505 --> 39:50.884 align:center line:79%
Hey, you ever actually kill any 
Mormons? Two, maybe three.

39:51.051 --> 39:53.387 align:center line:79%
Of course the young’uns, 
they don’t count for much.

39:53.387 --> 39:55.347 align:center line:79%
Yeah, but they're good
for target practice.

39:57.057 --> 39:59.893 align:center line:79%
Oh, some of them Mormons 
ran into the woods.

39:59.893 --> 40:02.479 align:center line:79%
The others of them hid
in their blacksmith shop.

40:04.356 --> 40:06.191 align:center line:81%
We aim right through the boards,

40:06.191 --> 40:08.152 align:center line:79%
and we started shooting 
them just like fish in a barrel.

40:10.320 --> 40:13.866 align:center line:79%
I found one ten-year-old boy trying
to hide and shot him dead,

40:13.866 --> 40:15.909 align:center line:79%
but I couldn't get his
father's boots off.

40:20.080 --> 40:25.335 align:center line:79%
Oh those Mormon women! Oh, 
now they put up a real fight

40:25.335 --> 40:27.629 align:center line:79%
Yeah, I remember. 2 or 3 of
them were hiding out.

40:28.005 --> 40:33.469 align:center line:79%
Silence. Silence. Silence! Ye
fiends of the infernal pit!

40:34.595 --> 40:39.933 align:center line:79%
In the name of Jesus Christ, I rebuke
you and command you to be still.

40:41.477 --> 40:44.938 align:center line:79%
I will not live another minute
and hear such language.

40:46.607 --> 40:51.195 align:center line:79%
Cease such talk, or you
or I die this instant.

41:05.751 --> 41:12.049 align:center line:79%
The worth of every soul is
great in the eyes of God.

41:19.973 --> 41:23.101 align:center line:79%
Many of our fathers and
brothers fought in

41:23.101 --> 41:28.398 align:center line:79%
the Revolutionary War and struggled to
establish a government of liberty

41:28.398 --> 41:30.859 align:center line:81%
and equal rights upon this land.

41:34.780 --> 41:40.869 align:center line:79%
We violated no laws. Yet thousands of
our innocent people were driven from

41:40.869 --> 41:43.956 align:center line:79%
place to place at the
peril of their lives.

41:48.252 --> 41:49.253 align:center line:81%
Smith.

41:50.087 --> 41:51.421 align:center line:81%
Get yourself up here.

41:58.011 --> 41:59.471 align:center line:81%
Don't you try nothing.

42:06.645 --> 42:07.813 align:center line:81%
So good to see you.

42:17.114 --> 42:18.115 align:center line:81%
Mary.

42:19.283 --> 42:20.325 align:center line:81%
Hyrum.

42:21.910 --> 42:26.915 align:center line:79%
I brought someone to meet you.
We have a fine new son.

42:30.168 --> 42:31.169 align:center line:81%
One at a time.

42:36.174 --> 42:39.636 align:center line:79%
As Joseph and Hyrum 
languished in the Liberty Jail,

42:39.678 --> 42:42.139 align:center line:81%
waiting to be tried for their lives,

42:43.557 --> 42:48.645 align:center line:79%
our people were scattered across
Missouri, Iowa, and Illinois.

42:53.567 --> 42:54.568 align:center line:81%
Tell Mary,

42:56.320 --> 42:57.321 align:center line:81%
and the children,

43:00.949 --> 43:02.451 align:center line:81%
I know this work is true.

43:07.706 --> 43:10.292 align:center line:81%
What a faithful heart you have, Hyrum.

43:15.631 --> 43:18.091 align:center line:81%
Oh, God. Where art thou?

43:20.510 --> 43:21.595 align:center line:81%
My son,

43:24.306 --> 43:26.016 align:center line:81%
peace be unto thy soul.

43:28.060 --> 43:32.064 align:center line:79%
Thine adversity and thine afflictions
shall be but a small moment.

43:34.650 --> 43:40.238 align:center line:79%
And then if thou endure it well.
God shall exalt thee on high.

43:46.828 --> 43:49.331 align:center line:81%
After six months in jail.

43:49.331 --> 43:54.461 align:center line:79%
And by the grace of God, Joseph and
Hyrum escaped their captors.

43:55.045 --> 43:58.632 align:center line:79%
We were reunited in Illinois,
where we felt welcomed.

43:59.299 --> 44:02.344 align:center line:79%
We hoped that our sufferings
had not been in vain

44:02.552 --> 44:05.806 align:center line:79%
and that we would now
enjoy a season of rest.

44:07.891 --> 44:12.270 align:center line:79%
Don't lose heart, brethren. Nauvoo
in Hebrew means beautiful place.

44:14.815 --> 44:16.525 align:center line:81%
What's the Hebrew word for swamp?

44:24.074 --> 44:26.660 align:center line:81%
During that first summer in Nauvoo,

44:26.868 --> 44:30.414 align:center line:79%
hundreds became sick with
chills and fever.

44:33.166 --> 44:36.086 align:center line:81%
Here, let me help you, sisters.

44:37.921 --> 44:42.426 align:center line:79%
Brother Joseph. My pride has
brought me very low.

44:45.470 --> 44:47.097 align:center line:81%
Now the Lord can lift you higher.

44:51.226 --> 44:54.813 align:center line:79%
Am I indeed the mother
of a prophet of God?

44:55.439 --> 44:58.191 align:center line:79%
The honored instrument in
performing so great

44:58.191 --> 45:04.656 align:center line:79%
a work that my soul did magnify and my
spirit rejoiced in God, my Savior?

45:32.684 --> 45:35.562 align:center line:81%
Within five years, Nauvoo grew into

45:35.562 --> 45:39.357 align:center line:79%
a thriving community
of some 15,000.

45:40.692 --> 45:45.489 align:center line:79%
At the same time, Joseph was considering
the wider world.

45:46.114 --> 45:49.701 align:center line:81%
The truth of God will go forth boldly,

45:49.826 --> 45:55.081 align:center line:79%
nobly, and independent until it has
penetrated every continent, sounded in

45:55.081 --> 45:59.002 align:center line:79%
every ear, and the purposes of
God shall be accomplished.

45:59.586 --> 46:03.715 align:center line:79%
God desires to bless all of His
children with light and truth

46:03.715 --> 46:11.681 align:center line:79%
and salvation. Brethren, a man filled
with the love of God cannot be content

46:11.681 --> 46:13.433 align:center line:81%
blessing his family alone.

46:15.685 --> 46:18.522 align:center line:79%
He will be anxious to bless
the whole human race.

46:20.857 --> 46:22.901 align:center line:81%
This is what the Lord desires for you.

46:26.321 --> 46:31.034 align:center line:79%
In 1830, the first missionaries set
out to share the Book of Mormon.

46:32.536 --> 46:36.706 align:center line:79%
In ancient days. God spoke to prophets
who in turn shared God’s word with

46:36.706 --> 46:39.584 align:center line:79%
all those who were willing 
to listen. God has again—

46:39.584 --> 46:43.630 align:center line:79%
God has again spoken to His prophets
who have given us His word.

46:43.630 --> 46:47.634 align:center line:79%
The Book of Amos teaches us that
this is part of God's plan.

46:47.676 --> 46:52.889 align:center line:79%
Ten years later, Brigham Young and the
other apostles were sent to England.

46:53.557 --> 46:58.061 align:center line:79%
Great success there dispelled any
thought that our faith was just

46:58.061 --> 46:59.604 align:center line:81%
an American religion.

47:00.021 --> 47:04.776 align:center line:79%
Good morning, brother. If ye ask with
a sincere heart having real intent

47:04.776 --> 47:08.238 align:center line:79%
and faith in Christ, He will 
manifest the truth of it unto you

47:08.238 --> 47:09.656 align:center line:81%
by the power of the Holy Ghost

47:09.656 --> 47:13.326 align:center line:79%
The missionaries sent out into the
world gathered converts by

47:13.326 --> 47:17.455 align:center line:79%
the thousands to help build Nauvoo
into the city of God.

47:23.753 --> 47:27.716 align:center line:79%
Boatloads came up the Mississippi
from the port of New Orleans.

47:29.009 --> 47:30.218 align:center line:81%
You play the pipes.

47:30.468 --> 47:32.929 align:center line:79%
Brother Joseph, please
don't encourage him.

47:36.099 --> 47:39.644 align:center line:79%
Still others came by any means
they could manage.

47:40.478 --> 47:44.941 align:center line:81%
We walked almost 900 miles to get here.

47:46.610 --> 47:48.278 align:center line:81%
God bless you. Jane Manning.

47:49.279 --> 47:53.783 align:center line:81%
Oh, He already has. He already has.

48:02.167 --> 48:03.627 align:center line:81%
Brother Joseph.

48:03.835 --> 48:04.836 align:center line:81%
Jesse.

48:06.087 --> 48:07.088 align:center line:81%
A word? Certainly. I was thinking. Yes.

48:07.130 --> 48:08.131 align:center line:81%
Certainly.

48:09.424 --> 48:10.675 align:center line:81%
I was thinking.

48:10.884 --> 48:11.885 align:center line:81%
Yes?

48:12.719 --> 48:15.055 align:center line:81%
People notice everything you do.

48:15.430 --> 48:23.396 align:center line:79%
And I wonder if a man of your position
should engage in such menial chores.

48:25.106 --> 48:29.945 align:center line:79%
Well, if there are demeaning things
to be done in a man's house,

48:30.362 --> 48:32.697 align:center line:79%
who better than the head of
the house to do them?

48:32.697 --> 48:35.450 align:center line:79%
Well, my wife does most
such work at our house.

48:36.201 --> 48:39.371 align:center line:79%
Maybe, maybe she could 
speak to Sister Emma.

48:42.666 --> 48:44.167 align:center line:81%
How long have you been married?

48:44.459 --> 48:46.336 align:center line:81%
Three years next month.

48:46.795 --> 48:49.965 align:center line:81%
That long? May I offer you some advice?

48:50.382 --> 48:51.383 align:center line:81%
Aye?

48:51.383 --> 48:55.929 align:center line:79%
The Lord intends for marriage to last
much longer than that. In fact, forever.

48:56.179 --> 49:01.726 align:center line:79%
Now, if a man is not willing to help
and cherish his wife here,

49:02.936 --> 49:07.565 align:center line:79%
why would she want him hereafter?
Now you give that some thought.

49:08.149 --> 49:10.110 align:center line:81%
Therein lies happiness, brother.

49:20.412 --> 49:21.997 align:center line:81%
Now there's a very wise man.

49:27.544 --> 49:28.920 align:center line:81%
They're beautiful.

49:30.255 --> 49:31.881 align:center line:81%
That's what made me think of you.

49:40.640 --> 49:45.854 align:center line:79%
It is the duty of a husband to love,
cherish and nourish his wife.

49:47.522 --> 49:49.232 align:center line:81%
One, two, three.

49:49.232 --> 49:50.233 align:center line:81%
Two, two.

49:50.233 --> 49:52.902 align:center line:81%
Do not count out loud.

49:52.902 --> 49:57.240 align:center line:79%
To honor her as himself. To regard
her feelings with tenderness.

49:57.574 --> 49:58.908 align:center line:81%
Counting again.

49:59.325 --> 50:03.121 align:center line:79%
For she is his flesh.
And she is his bone.

50:08.835 --> 50:13.423 align:center line:79%
The Lord hath revealed the sacred
sealing ordinances which bind families

50:13.423 --> 50:19.512 align:center line:79%
together in life will exist in eternity,
only coupled with eternal glory.

50:20.055 --> 50:24.684 align:center line:79%
We can one day dwell with
God as families.

50:29.355 --> 50:31.399 align:center line:81%
Just a little weary, that's all.

50:35.820 --> 50:38.656 align:center line:79%
You have watched after us all
of our lives, Father.

50:40.075 --> 50:41.326 align:center line:81%
That's what fathers do.

50:42.952 --> 50:44.496 align:center line:81%
Let us watch after you.

50:45.371 --> 50:46.372 align:center line:81%
Joseph

50:48.249 --> 50:49.584 align:center line:81%
Will I see Alvin again?

50:55.507 --> 50:59.135 align:center line:81%
Yes. You will see Alvin again.

50:59.511 --> 51:00.678 align:center line:81%
And be with him.

51:02.972 --> 51:08.895 align:center line:79%
You will always be his father. And
he will always be your son.

51:11.731 --> 51:14.818 align:center line:79%
The Lord has revealed
that that is His plan.

51:16.444 --> 51:19.030 align:center line:79%
We can be together with the
ones we love forever.

51:23.618 --> 51:26.871 align:center line:81%
We will all see Alvin again.

51:50.687 --> 51:56.317 align:center line:79%
Heave. Once more. Over,
over, easy, steady, good.

51:56.317 --> 52:01.072 align:center line:79%
It’s as magnificent as
they say. It will be.

52:01.531 --> 52:04.242 align:center line:79%
The Lord has great blessings
in store for all of us.

52:08.163 --> 52:10.415 align:center line:79%
Why does the Lord want us
to build another temple?

52:10.415 --> 52:13.751 align:center line:79%
It may seem to some a
very bold doctrine,

52:14.460 --> 52:17.046 align:center line:79%
a power which binds on
earth and in heaven.

52:19.132 --> 52:21.426 align:center line:79%
But God has restored that 
authority again.

52:22.594 --> 52:25.680 align:center line:79%
In the temple, we can receive
all the ordinances of salvation.

52:26.931 --> 52:31.436 align:center line:79%
Not only for ourselves, but for
those who have died without them.

52:33.938 --> 52:35.231 align:center line:81%
If we are faithful,

52:37.692 --> 52:40.320 align:center line:81%
all our losses will be made up.

52:43.114 --> 52:49.537 align:center line:79%
Even as a new, glorious temple rose up
in Nauvoo, the old fears returned.

52:49.871 --> 52:52.081 align:center line:79%
We would not be surprised 
to hear of the death

52:52.081 --> 52:54.459 align:center line:81%
of Joseph Smith by violent means.

52:54.459 --> 52:56.794 align:center line:81%
This isn’t news, it’s a threat.

52:59.005 --> 53:01.591 align:center line:79%
There's an easier way to get
rid of these Mormons.

53:03.218 --> 53:05.803 align:center line:79%
Old Joe Smith is still
wanted in Missouri.

53:07.889 --> 53:09.766 align:center line:81%
I say let them have him.

53:11.434 --> 53:12.560 align:center line:81%
Hold it right there, Smith.

53:12.602 --> 53:14.687 align:center line:81%
Don't move or you're a dead man.

53:15.355 --> 53:16.397 align:center line:81%
You gonna shoot me?

53:16.522 --> 53:17.523 align:center line:81%
Oh, no.

53:17.523 --> 53:20.360 align:center line:79%
We're taking you back to
Missouri for good.

53:20.360 --> 53:25.073 align:center line:79%
The governor of Missouri demanded Joseph
be extradited to stand trial

53:25.073 --> 53:26.824 align:center line:81%
again on false charges.

53:28.076 --> 53:30.787 align:center line:79%
Sadly, the Illinois authorities
honored the demand.

53:31.788 --> 53:32.872 align:center line:81%
Faster.

53:35.208 --> 53:36.334 align:center line:81%
Come on, boys.

53:36.584 --> 53:37.585 align:center line:81%
Yeah!

53:41.381 --> 53:45.426 align:center line:79%
Our men found him just before they
crossed the Illinois-Missouri border.

53:45.593 --> 53:47.971 align:center line:79%
Hold it right there! 
Stop where you’re at.

53:48.471 --> 53:52.392 align:center line:79%
Well, gentlemen, looks like I won't be
going with you to Missouri today,

53:53.685 --> 53:55.603 align:center line:79%
but just to show there
are no hard feelings,

53:56.271 --> 53:57.855 align:center line:81%
why don't you be my guest tonight?

54:04.821 --> 54:07.657 align:center line:79%
Gentlemen, I don't believe
we've had the pleasure.

54:11.536 --> 54:14.080 align:center line:81%
Might say we're the guests of honor.

54:15.873 --> 54:16.874 align:center line:81%
Oh.

54:18.376 --> 54:20.837 align:center line:81%
We rejoiced in the bold rescue.

54:21.045 --> 54:24.549 align:center line:79%
But the authorities took it
as an act of defiance.

54:25.591 --> 54:29.220 align:center line:81%
Joseph was given an ultimatum. Joseph.

54:31.806 --> 54:35.476 align:center line:79%
The governor insists that
we come to Carthage.

54:37.020 --> 54:41.691 align:center line:79%
The governor of Illinois promised my
sons would receive fair treatment.

54:43.568 --> 54:45.945 align:center line:81%
History suggested otherwise.

54:47.113 --> 54:50.825 align:center line:79%
If Hyrum and I do not do what
the governor orders,

54:51.159 --> 54:56.581 align:center line:79%
he will send the militia into Nauvoo.
And that will mean bloodshed.

54:57.498 --> 55:00.710 align:center line:79%
God does not want that. And
I can only do His will.

55:03.588 --> 55:05.882 align:center line:81%
Do you ever wonder if He asks too much?

55:13.097 --> 55:14.349 align:center line:81%
I do not let myself...

55:20.063 --> 55:21.356 align:center line:81%
Sometimes I do.

55:31.074 --> 55:33.701 align:center line:79%
I have longed with all my heart
to finish this temple.

55:35.745 --> 55:39.707 align:center line:79%
I shall never live to see it,
Brigham. You will.

55:43.127 --> 55:44.128 align:center line:81%
Promise me.

55:45.505 --> 55:49.050 align:center line:79%
When the time comes, you will lead our
people to the Rocky Mountains.

55:51.135 --> 55:52.136 align:center line:81%
Brethren.

55:54.305 --> 55:59.685 align:center line:79%
My mission is to testify
of Jesus Christ.

56:07.735 --> 56:08.778 align:center line:81%
I know that He lives.

58:10.024 --> 58:11.025 align:center line:81%
I love you, brother.

58:15.154 --> 58:18.115 align:center line:79%
Joseph and Hyrum arrived
in Carthage, Illinois,

58:18.115 --> 58:21.285 align:center line:79%
and surrendered themselves
to face charges.

58:29.460 --> 58:32.296 align:center line:79%
Despite all the promises
of fair treatment,

58:33.589 --> 58:36.342 align:center line:81%
what happened came as no surprise.

59:03.911 --> 59:04.912 align:center line:81%
Joseph!

59:11.752 --> 59:13.462 align:center line:81%
Hyrum! No!

59:17.842 --> 59:20.720 align:center line:79%
What do we hear in the gospel
that we have received?

59:23.848 --> 59:26.392 align:center line:81%
Truth out of the earth.

59:28.769 --> 59:30.479 align:center line:81%
Mercy from heaven.

59:32.481 --> 59:35.776 align:center line:79%
A voice of gladness for the
living and the dead.

59:45.077 --> 59:47.580 align:center line:81%
Shall we not go on in so great a cause?

59:57.381 --> 01:00:00.968 align:center line:79%
The mobs are determined. We shall not
have justice while we stay in Nauvoo.

01:00:03.721 --> 01:00:06.807 align:center line:81%
I do not know that I shall go west.

01:00:08.017 --> 01:00:12.355 align:center line:79%
But I pray that the Lord will let
Brother Brigham take the people away.

01:00:18.235 --> 01:00:22.823 align:center line:79%
I am the first witness of the
restoration of Christ’s Church upon

01:00:22.823 --> 01:00:29.121 align:center line:79%
the earth. I leave the world at liberty
to pass judgment upon what

01:00:29.121 --> 01:00:31.624 align:center line:81%
I have spoken, as seemeth them good.

01:00:33.668 --> 01:00:35.544 align:center line:81%
But this much I will say.

01:00:37.546 --> 01:00:40.049 align:center line:81%
All that I have told you is true.

01:00:42.218 --> 01:00:44.136 align:center line:81%
And will stand forever.

